<title>SPAIN: MOTORCYCLING-SPAIN'S CRIVILLE WINS SPANISH 500CC GRAND PRIX.</title>
<headline>MOTORCYCLING-SPAIN'S CRIVILLE WINS SPANISH 500CC GRAND PRIX.</headline>
<dateline>JEREZ DE LA FRONTERA, Spain 1997-05-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alex Criville</p>
<p>of Spain, riding a Honda, won the Spanish 500cc grand prix</p>
<p>motorcycle race on Sunday.</p>
<p>Michael Doohan of Australia finished second and Japan's</p>
<p>Tadayuki Okada was third, both on Hondas.</p>
</text>
